{"unit_id":"jackyytche__dsh-hindsight-memory#feature-1","repo":"jackyytche/dsh-hindsight-memory","commit":"444889040d73e150cb4b975ca55591b581da12a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hindsight-memory 的功能「回合开始自动召回」：在每轮第一次模型调用前，插件以最新的人类消息查询 Hindsight，并把找到的记忆作为上下文消息注入；琐碎问候和斜杠命令会跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:370-431"]}
